---
// The page in his own voice, before any of the work: who he is and what he is into.
---

<section id="about" class="wrap about" aria-labelledby="about-h" data-section="About" data-ground>
  <h2 id="about-h" data-reveal="title">About</h2>
  <div class="say" data-reveal="read">
    <p class="first">
      I'm Jerry. I'm from Toronto, and I study computer science at the University of Waterloo as a
      Schulich Leader.
    </p>
    <p>
      Space is the thing I find coolest: Dyson swarms, asteroid mining, and science fiction that takes
      its physics seriously, like the Xeelee Sequence. The cover of this page is that interest with
      the arithmetic done.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm also interested in AI agents and simulation, and I like questions you can settle by running
      the experiment. Do more coding agents fix more bugs? My experiments could not find the gain.
    </p>
    <p>
      I like making things people use. I started <a class="ln" href="#work">TopsOJ</a> in high school,
      and more than 100,000 people have used it. Now I work on AI video at Mathos and lead the software
      for Waterloo Defence's counter-drone turret.
    </p>
    <p>
      Most days I am programming alongside coding agents: more than 100 billion tokens so far.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    column-gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: baseline;
    padding-top: clamp(72px, 9vw, 136px);
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.038em;
  }
  .say {
    max-width: 40em;
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: -0.008em;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .say p + p {
    margin-top: 0.85em;
  }
  .first {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .say a {
    padding-block: 6px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .about {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      row-gap: 18px;
    }
    .say {
      font-size: 17px;
    }
  }
</style>
